check verification guidance in the linked design docs before editing oracles.
# @manual: primary
REQ-COMPILER-FRONTEND-001
doc/01_research/local/REQ-COMPILER-FRONTEND-001.md
doc/03_plan/sys_test/REQ-COMPILER-FRONTEND-001.md
